OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAUnionist co-operation in elections
OL,4,A'cannot benefit DUP alone'
OL,5,
OL,6,FRobinson said split votes had cost
OL,7,Funionist seats in a number of
OL,8,Fconstituencies and appealed to his
OL,9,Frival unionist parties to ensure that
OL,10,Fdid not happen again.
OL,12,FThe other two unionist leaders have not
OL,13,Fruled out working together but
OL,14,Fexpressed some scepticism about the DUP
OL,15,Fleader's request.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
